#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:5 6dfb1c7d46a943509fb47f00764a8d8b
msgid "MicoAir MTF-01 Optical Flow Sensor"
msgstr "MicoAir MTF-01 光流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:9 d5c2f89a596746d9baa12c4388595a65
msgid ""
"The is a lightweight 2 in 1 optical flow sensor including a short range "
"lidar which uses the serial MAVLink protocol to communicate with the "
"autopilot.  This can be used to improve horizontal position control "
"especially in GPS denied  or indoor environments."
msgstr ""
"这是一款轻量级二合一光流传感器，集成短距离激光雷达，通过串行 MAVLink 协议与飞控通信。可用于改善水平位置控制，尤其在无 GPS 或室内环境中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:16 bf366a77a740477d900df424a234fdff
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:18 be0d56e0166b4c01b2de658e5fed507f
msgid ""
"The sensor is available from `Aliexpress "
"<https://www.aliexpress.us/item/3256805359467554.html>`__ and other "
"resellers"
msgstr ""
"该传感器可从 `速卖通 <https://www.aliexpress.us/item/3256805359467554.html>`__ "
"及其他经销商购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:21 549e4b2ec67a49ea95eba7750765671c
msgid "Sensor Setup"
msgstr "传感器配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:23 3f51173c2a8c467eaa20307677b891fa
msgid ""
"Use MicoAir's MicoAssistant software using an FTDI adapter (USB to serial) "
"to set its output protocol to \"mav-apm\"."
msgstr "使用 MicoAir 的 MicoAssistant 软件通过 FTDI 适配器（USB 转串口）将其输出协议设置为「mav-apm」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:30 17246d3d35b84e719f74729f4c57f0e8
msgid ""
"With firmware versions 4.5.0 or above, MTF-01 may not be recognized by "
"Ardupilot unless you  use MicoAssistant to modify its “mav_id” to 200(any "
"value other than 1) and configure whichever serial port's "
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` its connected to  on the autopilot from \"0\" to "
"\"1024\"(“Don’t forward mavlink to/from” option)."
msgstr ""
"对于 4.5.0 或更高版本的固件，除非使用 MicoAssistant 将其「mav_id」修改为 200（任何非 1 的值），并将飞控上所连接串口的"
" ``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` 从「0」配置为「1024」（「不转发 mavlink」选项），否则 MTF-01 可能无法被 "
"ArduPilot 识别。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:33 d114a798bf564fb58954063b2a9447f6
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "与飞控的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:39 df2e2db9e71c4a0d9482ee5815b3e2b9
msgid ""
"The flow sensor should be mounted on the underside of the copter with the "
"camera lens pointing downwards."
msgstr "光流传感器应安装在飞行器底部，相机镜头朝下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:40 83c87642feb048939f492bdec50d10a7
msgid "Connect the sensor to the autopilots' serial port"
msgstr "将传感器连接到飞控的串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:43 ff88c51780f94a889d0fbef7c1dd9318
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:44 d19ad3a4445a49d5837c52b4ba3f1b59
msgid ""
"For the following we will assume it will be connected to Serial1 port of the"
" autopilot. Any serial port can be used, however."
msgstr "以下假设连接到飞控的 Serial1 端口。但可以使用任意串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:46 723235f616684192b2d3a088f2a346a5
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD<SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 115"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD<SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 115"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:47 6b4aaacb01724105bb3c4fec669247df
msgid "Set :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (MAVLink1)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 1（MAVLink1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:48 7f34e3afe6be4d3d91f2ba9d3f305c4e
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` = 5 (MAVLink)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` = 5（MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:49 70c69b8bd81c4b9fad6088f1689c5c51
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 10 (MAVLink)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 10（MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:50 f6f169944b9c42d9a9d9845bf8dd1871
msgid "Reboot autopilot to see rangefinder parameters"
msgstr "重启飞控以查看测距仪参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:51 6bb0656337f443a18ee2de9b56e9d30d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 8 to set range finder's maximum range"
" to 8m"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 8，将测距仪最大量程设为 8m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:52 e824f867ac494f7dacb0e6fc312fc199
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.01"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.01"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:53 18e3fe502a27499a91c9657110874514
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (Downward)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（朝下）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:55 f1eca0a1bae64da49d25efc79eea0d98
msgid ""
"Once the sensor is active you should be able to observe the optical flow and"
" range sensor data on the Mission Planner’s “Status” page. The “opt_qua” and"
" “rangefinder1” should have some value."
msgstr ""
"传感器激活后，你应该能在 Mission Planner "
"的「Status」页面上观察到光流和测距仪数据。「opt_qua」和「rangefinder1」应有数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:58 9740c6f6feb74ef881bc19cc1e54658b
msgid "Optical Flow Use and Calibration"
msgstr "光流使用与校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mtf-01.rst:60 a1b8d315c25845679c5ca8ffaf4219a2
msgid ""
"Be sure to follow the setup and calibration instructions and parameters for "
":ref:`Optical Flow setup <common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>` and how to "
"switch between outdoor(GPS) and indoor (Optical Flow) positioning."
msgstr ""
"请务必遵循 :ref:`光流传感器配置 <common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>` "
"的配置和校准说明及参数，以及如何在室外（GPS）和室内（光流）定位之间切换。"
